    <h1>Tools that turn intent into <em>momentum.</em></h1>
    <p class="page-lede">Kodon combines capable AI agents with a focused workspace, giving you the right support at every stage of the work.</p>
    <div class="feature-detail-grid">
        <article class="feature-detail feature-detail-dark"><span class="feature-icon">✦</span><span class="feature-index">01</span><h2>Agentic execution</h2><p>Move beyond one-off prompts. Give Kodon a goal and let specialized agents break it down, research options, and produce a useful first draft.</p><a class="text-link link-light" href="/platform">Explore the platform →</a></article>
        <article class="feature-detail"><span class="feature-icon">⌘</span><span class="feature-index">02</span><h2>Context that compounds</h2><p>Keep briefs, files, decisions, and conversations together. Your workspace gets more useful as your work evolves.</p><a class="text-link" href="/get-started">Build your workspace →</a></article>
        <article class="feature-detail"><span class="feature-icon">◒</span><span class="feature-index">03</span><h2>Reviewable by default</h2><p>See what your agents are doing, guide the approach, and approve important outputs before they move forward.</p><a class="text-link" href="/docs">Read the documentation →</a></article>
        <article class="feature-detail"><span class="feature-icon">↗</span><span class="feature-index">04</span><h2>Ready for real work</h2><p>From product planning to client preparation, Kodon helps transform a blank page into an outcome you can use.</p><a class="text-link" href="/use-cases">See use cases →</a></article>
    </div>
</section>
